80:    * <p>
81:    * The properties of {@code globalProperties} that begin with {@code propertyPrefix} are extracted into a new property set,
82:    * with the property names having the prefix removed.
83:    * This becomes the {@code overrideProperties} for the delegation to {@link #createFromProperties(ClassLoader, java.util.Properties, java.util.Properties)}.
84:    *
85:    * @param classLoader The classloader to use to find the properties file
