40:  * So {@code thymeleafTemplate("my/template/path")} maps to {@code thymeleaf/my/template/path.html} in the application root directory.
41:  * This can be configured using {@link #setTemplatesPrefix(String)} and {@link #setTemplatesSuffix(String)} as well as
42:  * {@code other.thymeleaf.templatesPrefix} and {@code other.thymeleaf.templatesSuffix} configuration properties.
43:  * </p>
