413:    * current root.
414:    *
415:    * @param handler the handler to delegate to
416:    * @return this
417:    * @see Chain#post(Handler)
418:    * @see Chain#put(Handler)
419:    * @see Chain#patch(Handler)
420:    * @see Chain#delete(Handler)
