270:   /**
271:    * Converts a {@link Promise} into a {@link Maybe}.
272:    * <p>
273:    * The returned Maybe emits the promise's single value if it succeeds, and emits the error (i.e. via {@code onError()}) if it fails.
274:    * <p>
275:    * This method works well as a method reference to the {@link Promise#to(ratpack.func.Function)} method.
276:    * <pre class="java">{@code
277:    * import ratpack.rx2.RxRatpack;
278:    * import ratpack.exec.Promise;
279:    * import ratpack.test.exec.ExecHarness;
