27: /**
28:  * A handler implementation that collects {@link Timer} metrics for a {@link Request}.
29:  * <p>
30:  * Metrics are grouped by {@link ratpack.http.Request#getUri()} and {@link ratpack.http.Request#getMethod()}.
31:  * For example, the following requests...
32:  *
33:  * <pre>
34:  * /
